OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Some light and patchy
OL,7,Frain will spread east overnight for a
OL,8,Ftime. A few showers continuing across
OL,9,Fthe west otherwise becoming dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FSome early brightness in the
OL,12,Feast. Otherwise rather cloudy with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain spreading east for a
OL,14,Ftime.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,17,Fwill spread northeast on Wednesday.
OL,18,FDry with bright spells on Thursday. A
OL,19,Ffew showers on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
